{"unit_id": "tag:048K:statement", "translation": "令<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme），令<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic space）。\n令<MATH_0004>为<MATH_0005>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）中的预关系（relation）。\n如果在<MATH_0006>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）范畴（category）中存在范畴商（quotient），则它在唯一同构（isomorphism）的意义下唯一。\n对于<MATH_0007>的满子范畴（full subcategories）中的范畴商（quotients），也有类似结论。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "relation", "target_term": "关系"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "quotient", "target_term": "商"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "full subcategories", "target_term": "满子范畴"}, {"source_term": "quotients", "target_term": "商"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定基底概形。"}, {"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间", "context": "基底上的代数空间。"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间", "context": "此处的对象与商所在范畴。"}, {"source_term": "relation", "target_term": "关系", "context": "此处为代数空间中的预关系。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "此处的范畴商所在范畴。"}, {"source_term": "quotient", "target_term": "商", "context": "存在时在唯一同构意义下唯一的范畴商。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "用于范畴商的唯一性。"}, {"source_term": "full subcategories", "target_term": "满子范畴", "context": "原范畴的满子范畴。"}, {"source_term": "quotients", "target_term": "商", "context": "满子范畴内的范畴商。"}], "notes": []}
